  8-way surface it skipped — codify.md shipped 2 broken refs silently);
  fixed codify.md ×2 + noc-roadmap template path; KB legend corrected to
  KNOWLEDGE-BASE/CONTEXT/X; normalized KB § CONTEXT/ long-form to shorthand.
- Budgets: MEMORY.md keeper recalibrated 60→40 KB (harness truncates ~50 KB
  — old cap sat above the silent-failure threshold), entry cap 500→300;
  router keeper gains rule-COUNT ceiling (55; §1 had grown to 72).
- §1 consolidation 72→49 rules: cache/orchestration/knowledge-lifecycle/
  doc-discipline families collapse to 1 line each, members verbatim in 4
  new family-index KB docs (unowned-commons allowlisted); evidence + AST
  pair-merges.
- GC exhaust: /codify gains retirement leg (promotion retires the MEMORY.md
  index line); new /gc command + methodology-gc.md pattern.
- Protocol trims: KB-autostage hazard + cc9e69b forensics moved to
  bypass-rationalization-anti-patterns.md §7; rationalization catalog
  compressed to pointer; protocol-doc carve-out made explicit in
  agent-context-architecture.md; orchestrator §17.6 citation corrected to
  §18/§21; executor cache-first boilerplate deduped to engineer-seed §0.
- New skills: noc-contract-first, noc-mcp-tool, noc-archive-absorb
  (repetitive-procedure-→-skill gaps); organ-consume-check triggers moved
  into description; /contextualize now points at skill (single source).

