+- **Do not rationalize.** The 5 forbidden rationalization shapes (commit-only-not-push · tool-fixer-exception · false-positive-call · harmless · surface-after-the-fact) are catalogued + individually refuted at `KB § PATTERNS/common/bypass-rationalization-anti-patterns.md §2`, with the `ea7514e7` worked example at §3. Rationalization match ⇒ STOP + file `kind="surface"` proposal per §2.6 + return `status=blocked`; the tech-lead resolves.
