ifact-lose-journey (alternatives + errors = 90% of dev cost) · knowledge in commit messages only (not queryable by intent) · per-session findings.md only (knowledge dies with worktree) · one-shot e2e with no status field. Worked example = the seed-organs-cache project active 2026-05-29 (the body-layer companion that materializes this rule's schema as a seed primitive); recursive proof = this codification's own journey IS this KB doc's own first knowledge-cache entry. Stage 4 keeper `check_artifact_has_knowledge_sidecar` deferred — lands after seed-organs-cache ships the body since the storage shape has to exist first. Composes with project-execution `findings absorption` (extends granularity from project-scoped + close-only to artifact-scoped + real-time) · repetitive-task-skill-codification (skill-DRY sibling) · methodology-codification-pipeline (s1→s4 cadence) · noc-graph (new `artifact_knowledge` node kind + `learned_from`/`surfaced_drift` edges) · scoped-auto-improvement (two-leg footer is the source stream for drifts_surfaced + bugs_fixed_during_dev) · persistent-files-absorption (same family, finer granularity) · cache-as-agent-tool (build-knowledge cache becomes a consultable cache) · dispatch-with-project-and-notes (dispatch brief carries the build-learn-cache obligation) | `CONTEXT/PATTERNS/common/build-learn-cache-mindset.md` |
